        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_mamba.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 36eab2c5-79b3-4aca-bf8b-8b40ff64c3d5).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to the Italian coastal town of Sapienza. \r\rYou have three targets: Christina Dionisi, a talented singer; Galileo Milani, a global social media influencer; and Luca Mannucci, an IT magnate. Together, they are co-owners of the Sanguine branch in Italy. They are responsible for greenwashing customers, making  them believe their products are environmentally-friendly. Our client, Sanguine CEO, Viktor Novikov, believes that if the media found out, the company&apos;s reputation would be damaged.",
